## Why This Is Asked
Observability in multi-tenant KCNA is critical to pinpoint cross-tenant interference and regressions with low overhead.

## Key Concepts
- OpenTelemetry across producers, KCNA, sinks
- Trace context propagation via message headers
- Tenant isolation and correlation
- Per-tenant dashboards and sampling trade-offs

## Code Example
