## Why This Is Asked
This question probes ability to design realistic, scalable A/B testing in KCNA with strict tenant isolation, deterministic sampling, and auditable results.

## Key Concepts
- Multi-tenant data partitioning and sandbox isolation
- Deterministic per-tenant sampling and evaluation
